OL,3,AMan guilty of stealing cash from farm
OL,4,Aowned by South African president
OL,5,
OL,6,FA court in South Africa has found a man
OL,7,Fguilty of stealing more than $500,000
OL,8,F(#372,822) in cash from a farm owned by
OL,9,FSouth African president Cyril
OL,10,FRamaphosa, in a case that mired the
OL,11,Fhead of state in an impeachment saga.
OL,13,FImanuwela David was found guilty of
OL,14,Ftheft on Monday, as well as conspiracy
OL,15,Fto commit housebreaking with intent to
OL,16,Fsteal at Phala Phala farm in the
OL,17,FLimpopo province in 2020.
OL,19,FFroliana Joseph, a cleaner at the
OL,20,Fproperty, was also found guilty of
OL,21,Fconspiracy to commit housebreaking with
OL,22,Fintent to steal.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
